<title>USA: IHOP March same-store sales up 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>IHOP March same-store sales up 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said on Thursday same store sales for the fiscal month of March 1997 were up 3.8 percent compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>IHOP develops, franchises and operates International House of Pancakes restaurants. As of December 31, 1996, the company said it had 729 restaurants of which 535 were operated by franchisees, 58 by the company, and 136 by area licensees.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
